Unit 4 Analysis
In Unit 4, I learned about Android app architecture, state management, and navigation. The Dessert app helped me understand how an application responds to lifecycle changes. The Lunch Tray app showed me how users can move between different screens and carry information from one screen to another.
In the Sports app, I learned how to organize content and create layouts for different screen sizes. Overall, this unit helped me understand how to build Android applications that are organized, responsive, and easier to maintain.
